  m_text: "The Packing Fraction represents the fraction of volume in a crystal structure
    that is actually occupied by atoms (assumed to be hard spheres).\r\n\r\nAPF =
    (Natoms x Vatom)/ Vunit cell \r\n\r\n\nBody-Centered (BCC): APF \u2248  0.68
    (68% full). \nAtoms touch along the body diagonal (a\u221A3 = 4r).\n"
